OL,3,GNEWSANew lithium mine 'to create more
OL,4,Athan 100 jobs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new lithium mine is set to create
OL,7,Fmore than 100 jobs under government
OL,8,Fplans, bosses say.
OL,10,FGeothermal Engineering Limited said it
OL,11,Fwould invest about #43m in a lithium
OL,12,Fextraction facility in Cornwall, which
OL,13,Fit planned to bring into commercial
OL,14,Fproduction in 2029.
OL,16,FOfficials said it was part of
OL,17,Fgovernment plans to boost industrial
OL,18,Fresilience and help secure vital supply
OL,19,Fchains backing automotive, clean energy
OL,20,Fand advanced manufacturing sectors.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
