OL,3,GNEWSANew lithium mine 'to create more
OL,4,Athan 100 jobs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCEO Dr Ryan Law said the UK had an
OL,7,Fimportant opportunity to develop
OL,8,Fresources, technology and expertise for
OL,9,Fa domestic lithium supply, and they
OL,10,Fwere "proud to be building that
OL,11,Fcapability here in Cornwall, bringing
OL,12,Fjobs and new investment to the local
OL,13,Farea."
